ely free living pandas in the  wild this is a story about connections  between people between cultures even  between animals kristin is really the  perfect person to narrate this film and  we're just so happy she's doing it  Kristen has such an incredible empathy  for animals  and really you know cares about them the  only way you can really bring an  audience into this world is with the  IMAX experience IMAX is so immersive it  really transports you into the actual  environment it feels like you're there  right beside the pandas it's a really  unique experience  [Music]  [Music]
 

